          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वन्यजीव — vanyajīv — \"wildlife\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "या जंगलात खूप वन्यजीव आहेत. yā jaṅgalāt khūp vanyajīv āhet. There is a lot of wildlife in this forest."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A formal word for the wild animals and birds of a region."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वन्यजीव (vanyajīv) is a modern word built from Sanskrit vanya, \"growing or living in a forest\", and jīva, \"a living being\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
